# ElTo 30-fonts. The SDDM theme (spike/sddm/README.md) expects Nunito and
# Noto Serif Display. Verified against the live Arch repos on 2026-11-27.

ttf-dejavu        # Reliable fallback UI font (VM-proven list).
noto-fonts        # Main text coverage incl. Noto Serif Display (SDDM theme).
noto-fonts-extra  # Additional Noto scripts and weights (VM-proven list).
noto-fonts-emoji  # Color emoji.
ttf-nunito        # Nunito, expected by the elto-classic SDDM theme.
